  "headline": "TIER-1 F-ANCHOR CANDIDATE: Scholz ratio E[3^r_3 | imag] / E[3^r_3 | real] converges monotonically to CL-predicted 3/2 as |disc| grows. Bucket 3: 1.465, Bucket 6: 1.489 \u2014 deviation from 1.5 shrinks from 3.5% to 1.1% across 3 decades of |disc|. 3-rank distributions themselves also converge to CL predictions at every k=0,1,2,3 in both families.",
